OL,3,AUS army warns detonation of unstable
OL,4,Aexplosives will create toxic plume
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Army is set to detonate five
OL,7,Ftonnes of degraded explosive material
OL,8,Fin Middletown, Iowa, and have urged
OL,9,Flocals to vacate the area or stay
OL,10,Findoors for their safety.
OL,12,FThe detonations will result in an air
OL,13,Fplume that could send toxic dust,
OL,14,Fcontaining lead particles, over eastern
OL,15,FIowa and into neighbouring Illinois,
OL,16,Fwith the potential for contaminants to
OL,17,Fsettle on farmland, playgrounds and
OL,18,Fother surfaces, the army said.
OL,20,FThe two controlled explosions will be
OL,21,Fpowerful enough that they could damage
OL,22,Fbuildings and shatter windows nearby.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
