OL,3,AUS army warns detonation of unstable
OL,4,Aexplosives will create toxic plume
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, environmental groups sued
OL,7,Fin an effort to stop the detonations,
OL,8,Farguing the army failed to consider
OL,9,Fsafer alternatives or give adequate
OL,10,Fnotice.
